+## Decisions & Alternatives
+
+| Decision | Chosen | Alternatives Considered | Rationale |
+|----------|--------|------------------------|-----------|
+| Lookup backend | Local embedded SQLite index | On-site HTTPS directory; Managed search service | Predictable offline lookups with no service to run; each kiosk validates and rebuilds its own index on snapshot arrival, keeping all maintenance inside the registry component. On-site HTTPS would require lab network and timeout handling. Managed search adds recurring cost, credentials, and external connectivity concerns. Certificate interface unchanged in all options. |
+
+## Open Questions & Future Decisions
+
+### Resolved
+1. ✅ Lookup backend selected as local embedded SQLite index.
+
+### Deferred
+1. Index rebuild performance budget for 150 MB snapshots on 4 GB RAM kiosks.
